 <rules><rule id="5139598e-4787-5cf1-bfff-d9ee4421d8ba" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="39706b7c-0342-5345-ba77-50e4cb6f930f" name="Line" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="5c621fcd-1cd9-5da8-9eb6-99b50ad76593" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="5d23d289-9079-5eb0-8cc6-f248281fb9d4" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="f53c16d6-96de-5ece-82b2-d9bc995e1900" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="ee8eb7b1-694e-5bd9-86f8-f5cac76ad1a8" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="09cab10a-c4d7-5d9b-8ca4-ba144b188b04" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="ef337c9f-a5db-5e9f-98f7-89fe7caee3ca" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="116d90a0-5fe0-5039-8491-a91ee162de7c" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="e26de545-edab-5a22-a810-8e008f52322f" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="c51a2589-ad4e-5a04-aba6-bfb5cb81962c" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="a0ed0a3f-b35e-514f-a409-7f1f4a32feaa" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule><rule id="b69a572a-7fb4-54ec-8e8a-ad527e16a902" name="Independent Warship" hidden="false"><description>A Light Cruiser is taken singly and never forms a squadron. It is built to hunt, patrol and raid alone.</description></rule><rule id="8c133fbf-6d1c-58bb-9007-e004d60388b8" name="Light Hull" hidden="false"><description>A Light Cruiser may not mount Triple Lance Turrets; its dorsal mount takes a Lance Turret or a Twin Lance Turret only.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="499b3a81-cf6e-5559-869e-1491a11e2e31" name="Line" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup name="Prow Mounts" id="c10e8bab-c310-52df-9418-2a46bed7f792" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="2e8bc84f-0d5f-5782-950e-e645d7745992" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="6d2d94b8-49f0-5bbe-99d6-e0d90c0d84df" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="12033c91-c889-5bcb-9828-1e9792e200f1" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="bf063702-6bfa-5007-a14b-31711aa1da53" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One torpedo per tube. Bypasses Void Shields; Armourbane within 6″; Reload (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Dorsal Mounts" id="d82b013b-7cd6-5619-a1ef-690d864555b4" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="0165d2